"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_30","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Te détendre, penser au relâchement, à une foulée efficace, travailler un détail technique ou tout simplement profiter de ton environnement… Les objectifs sont multiples en footing. Choisis celui qui te fait le plus envie aujourd’hui… mais surtout, cours lentement et contrôle ton allure !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":329,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1785715200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":329}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_30+4LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Encore un footing accompagné de lignes droites ! J'espère que tu ressens l'effet positif que ces lignes droites ont sur ta mécanique ? Personnellement, je me sens vraiment \"bien dans ma foulée\" après avoir fait des lignes droites ! C'est comme si ça remettait tout en place !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_26","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":329,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":26,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":212,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":342,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1785715200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1560,"pace":{"value":329}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - REPRISE  - SEMAINE 2 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 2 blocs. Le premier bloc est composé de 4 séries de 5 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second bloc est composé de 3 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Prenez 1'30 de récupération entre les séries du premier bloc et 1' entre celles du second. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Les exercices en statiques sont peu utilisés alors que très bon pour la santé, la performance tout en étant peu traumatiques. Ils seront par la suite beaucoup utilisés, dans différents contextes, donc autant s'y habituer.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"moderate","durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02dAnQYrsSalA01mNjkty8xiu","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"Xh02xvMtrbJimagSnxQkz00TA2tvuktddc","format":"desktop"}