ies de 2x2 exercices différents alternés, enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1 et 2, et 2' entre les séries du bloc 3. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"N'hésite pas à ajuster l'intensité des exercices en fonction de ta fatigue du jour. Mieux vaut une séance un peu plus légère qui n'impactera pas le reste de ta préparation, que de forcer, de se blesser ou de mal récupérer avant le prochain fractionné.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Extension de Mollet","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":15,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 2 pieds","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"LRwmfIIbjAq00CUzgNV9QJD00cjxpce6mY","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"wEJw8kcN6TSOZ2k7EYrOxnzFlrfkS3XX","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 1 pied","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394758-dsc4263.png","muxPlaybackId":"1R00Rw81qTAo69DGhdMVO1ZhipUK5euzU","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://image.mux.com/dlCXEee8u01EZxzO1zB7raAYosslztFte/thumbnail.jpg","muxPlaybackId":"dlCXEee8u01EZxzO1zB7raAYosslztFte","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Extension Mollet à 1 pied avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394833-dsc4270.png","muxPlaybackId":"4IWQj9FusbAG6rA2bIJd6kf3gJzgQCEn","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394833-dsc4270.png","muxPlaybackId":"01brVbo2iL201c02T5ep7PjTZ00nODTWfkJb","format":"mobile"}]}],"gear":"weight