WithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_30","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Ne te laisse pas emporter par l'énergie du moment : À trois semaines de la course, la charge d'entraînement diminue et tu vas sûrement te sentir en forme, mais ce n’est pas le moment de forcer. Reste calme et contrôlé sur ta séance d’endurance fondamentale pour préserver tes réserves et ne pas brûler de cartouches avant l’objectif.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":325,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1794787200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"VO2_7x60-90_Cote_Affutage","description":"Séance VMA **EN COTE**. Sur cette séance, tu enchaînes **7 fois** 1' rapides et 1'30 lentes pour te laisser le temps de redescendre.","displayName":"VO2max","coachAdvice":"Lors de cette séance de 1min à VO2, rappelle-toi que tu devrais être capable de tenir cette intensité pendant environ 5 minutes en condition idéale. Si tu te sens épuisé après seulement 30 secondes, il faudra ajuster ton effort. Tu as maintenant l'expérience nécessaire pour bien gérer cette intensité.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"trail_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"WU_20 ","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":325,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":7,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"VMA_Cote_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":210,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":60,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"uphill","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Down_1.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":338,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":90,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"downhill","manualLap":true}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":325,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1794787200000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a68a385ce2d2a7e262eb471","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1794787200000,"sessionIndex":2,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":600,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":36,"metri